# Chinese translations for token_repeat_pattern.md
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Language: zh_CN\n"

msgid "# Token repetition detection (pattern backend)"
msgstr "# Token 重复检测（pattern 后端）"

msgid ""
"`token_repeat` uses a fixed pattern-based rule set with 64 raw-token check\n"
"boundaries and a final partial-block flush. There is no sliding-window\n"
"algorithm and no `algorithm` selector."
msgstr "`token_repeat` 使用固定的基于 pattern 的规则集，在 64 个原始 token 检查边界处判定，并在末尾做部分块 flush。不再提供滑动窗口算法，也没有 `algorithm` 选择器。"

msgid "Build the optional CPU extension independently in the serving environment (Linux, C++17):"
msgstr "在推理环境中独立构建可选 CPU 扩展（Linux，C++17）："

msgid "Set these fields under `detector.token_repeat` in runtime_config:"
msgstr "在 runtime_config 的 `detector.token_repeat` 下设置："

msgid ""
"Use `-1` for chat mode, or the model's explicit `</think>` token ID for reasoning.\n"
"Tables are built from the served model's `tokenizer.json` during enable-time\n"
"warmup. ByteLevel BPE is supported; remote model IDs require tokenizer.json in\n"
"the local HF cache. The table stays in memory and is released when the detector\n"
"is disabled. Warmup logs vocabulary size and elapsed time, with a warning above\n"
"the 5-second target."
msgstr "chat 模式使用 `-1`；推理场景使用模型显式的 `</think>` token ID。启用时预热阶段从所服务模型的 `tokenizer.json` 构建表。支持 ByteLevel BPE；远程模型 ID 需要本地 HF 缓存中有 tokenizer.json。表常驻内存，检测器禁用时释放。预热会记录词表大小与耗时，超过 5 秒目标会告警。"

msgid ""
"Warmup failure is logged once for that enable attempt and leaves detection\n"
"unavailable; inference can continue. Fix the extension/resources and\n"
"disable/re-enable to retry. Rebinding to a different model rebuilds the tables."
msgstr "某次启用若预热失败只会记一次日志，检测不可用，但推理可继续。修好扩展/资源后，通过禁用再启用以重试。换绑到不同模型会重建表。"

msgid ""
"Detection uses the existing CPU ActionQueue and Incident actions. Terminal\n"
"tails are checked before Store cleanup after CPU jobs drain. Forced cleanup at\n"
"the deferred-wave limit can skip the terminal check for outstanding jobs; this\n"
"is explicitly logged."
msgstr "检测复用现有 CPU ActionQueue 与 Incident 动作。CPU 任务排空后、Store 清理前会检查终端尾巴。在延迟波次上限强制清理时，可能跳过未完成任务的终端检查；该情况会显式打日志。"

msgid ""
"Focused regression tests are in `tests/ut/runtime_guard/test_token_repeat_pattern.py`.\n"
"Native cases require the optional extension and skip when it is absent."
msgstr "专项回归测试见 `tests/ut/runtime_guard/test_token_repeat_pattern.py`。原生用例需要可选扩展，缺失时 skip。"
